# > Rule_Update (规则更新相关)
# 核心域名后缀精确匹配
HOST-SUFFIX, raw.githubusercontent.com, Rule_Update
HOST-SUFFIX, gist.githubusercontent.com, Rule_Update
HOST-SUFFIX, githubusercontent.com, Rule_Update
HOST-SUFFIX, github.com, Rule_Update
HOST-SUFFIX, whatshub.top, Rule_Update

# 使用关键词匹配替代你原来的带星号(*)写法，涵盖所有可能的后缀
HOST-KEYWORD, github, Rule_Update
HOST-KEYWORD, githubusercontent, Rule_Update
HOST-KEYWORD, whatshub, Rule_Update